        {
            "_id": "LTPno6BNxfWzaOcb",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
            "name": "Frightful Battle Cry",
            "sort": 700000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The last guards unleash a soul-shaking bellow in unison. All creatures in a @Template[cone|distance:60] take @Damage[7d6[sonic]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[will|dc:42|basic|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened]). Any creature that fails its save is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 3} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 4} on a critical failure).</p>\n<p>If the troop occupies 8 or fewer squares, this area decreases to a @Template[cone|distance:30].</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
