        {
            "_id": "5drMiSKo8WlROHxh",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/ThreeActions.webp",
            "name": "Spectral Charge",
            "sort": 900000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 3
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The last guards charge, swarming through their foes. The troop Flies up to double its Speed, dealing @Damage[4d8[void]] damage to each creature whose space it moves through (@Check[reflex|dc:40|basic|options:inflicts:drained]). Any creature that fails its save is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Drained]{Drained 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Drained]{Drained 2} on a critical failure). The troop can affect each creature only once in a single use of Spectral Charge.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
